<a id="secproprietes"></a><div class="frame"><h3 class="l2w_content thm">Proposition : \titproposition</h3><div class="l2w_content thm">
	    Soit \( a \) et \( b \) deux nombres positifs, on a&nbsp;:
	    <p class="math">\( \sqrt{a}\times \sqrt{b}=\sqrt{ab}\)</p> 
	    De plus, si \( b \not = 0 \), on a aussi&nbsp;:
	    <p class="math">\( \sqrt{\frac{a}{b}}=\frac{\sqrt{a}}{\sqrt{b}} \)</p>
	</div>
<h3 class="l2w_content exemple">Exemple : \titexemple [\reload{<img src = "gifs/doc/etoile.gif" alt = "rechargez" width = "20" height = "20">}]</h3><div class="l2w_content exemple"><div class="columns">
			<div style="width:0.45\textwidth; display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;" class="column">
   
				\def{matrix a=2,8,16,4
				2,18,36,6
				2,32,64,8
				2,50,100,10
				5,20,100,10
				10,10,100,10
				2,72,144,12
				4,36,144,12
				9,16,144,12
				}
				\def{text a=randomrow(\a)}
				\def{integer a1=\a[1]}
				\def{integer a2=\a[2]}
				\def{integer a3=\a[3]}
			 <div class="math">\(\begin{matrix} 
				A & = & \sqrt{\a1} \times \sqrt{\a2} \\ 
			    A & = & \sqrt{\a3}   \\ 
			    A & = & \a[4] 
			\end{matrix})</div></div>
<div style="width:0.45\textwidth; display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;" class="column">
   
				\def{integer bb1=random(2..15)}
				\def{integer b1=(\bb1)^2}
				\def{integer bb2=random(2..15)}
				\def{integer b2=(\bb2)^2}
				\def{rational r=\bb1 / \bb2}
				\def{text comp1=\bb1/\bb2}
				\def{text comp2=\r}
				\if{\comp1=\comp2}{\def{text sol=}}{\def{text sol=B&=&\r}}
		 <div class="math">\(\begin{matrix} 
			B & = & \sqrt{\frac{\b1}{\b2}} \\ 
		    B & = &\frac{\sqrt{\b1}}{\sqrt{\b2}}   \\ 
		    B & = & \frac{\bb1}{\bb2} \\
			\sol
		\end{matrix})</div></div>
</div></div>
</div><div class="frame"><div class="frametitle">Attention</div>
<div class="columns"><div style="width:0.45\textwidth; display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;" class="column">
   
